window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>In a village on the edge of the Frontier, D is among the warriors and mercenaries hired to defend the village from the Black Death, a notorious bandit gang. </p><p></p><p>But the bandits don’t arrive, and the village mayor dismisses the mercenaries. </p><p></p><p>As D leaves the scene, he’s struck by “sunlight syndrome”—the deadly ailment unique to dhampirs!</p><p></p><p>Adapted from the novel and produced with a full cast of actors, immersive sound effects and cinematic music!</p><p></p><p>Performed by Scott McCormick, Daniel Llaca, Erin Lin, David Cui Cui, Tony Nam, Terence Aselford, Shravan Amin, Jacob Yeh, Ken Jackson, Danny Montooth, Su Ling Chan, Rose Elizabeth Supan, James Lewis, Jameson Hunt, Kelly Baskin, Jonathon Church, Drew Kopas, Nora Achrati, Laura C. Harris, and Christopher Williams.</p>"; 
